        <h1>About Adrian Parker</h1>

        <p>I'm Adrian Parker, and I live in Wellington, New Zealand.</p>

        <p>When I first started this site, I thought I might write <a href="/posts/">posts</a> about product management, finance, software, investment and travel, adorned with whimsical anecdotes about life. And sometimes I do - most commonly whimsical anecdotes.</p>
        
        <p>I review <a href="/gigs/">gigs</a> I go to, and keep a <a href="/Gig-History/">history of every show I remember</a> (and a few I don't). I also publish a few <a href="/apps/">browser-based apps</a>.</p>

        <p>Away from the keyboard I'm a keen beginner scuba diver (see <a href="/posts/Tangalooma-Wrecks/">Tangalooma Wrecks</a> and <a href="/posts/Beqa-Lagoon-Shark-Dive-1/">sharks at Beqa Lagoon</a>), and I'm passionate about football, following Fulham FC and Wellington Phoenix closely. I'm a retired <a href="/posts/Last-Ever-Last-Ever/">bootleg kingpin</a> and a reformed <a href="/posts/Wine-Cork-Notice-Board-How-To/">wine enthusiast</a>.</p>

        <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
        <p>If you want to reach out, a message on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/adrianparker">LinkedIn</a> should always find me.</p>
        <p>Spotted something wrong or broken on this site? <a href="https://github.com/adrianparker/adrianparker.github.io/issues">Open an issue on GitHub</a>.</p>

        <p>Thanks for checking my site out! I hope there is something here you like.</p>
        <p>If you subscribe your email below, not only will I love you forever, I'll also reach out when something is new. Go on, make my day!</p>

        <br/>
